This is Microsoft's unmodified signed installer, not Sanketa source code.
Microsoft's installer displays its own license and installation choices.
It requires internet access and the player's Windows administrator approval.
Sanketa does not install these components silently.

This package adds optional legacy SDK libraries. It does not install or repair
the DirectX 11/12 runtime included with Windows, graphics drivers or game files.
The Sanketa client does not require these legacy SDK libraries for its
ordinary graphics/audio paths. Windows core graphics repairs use Windows Update.
